---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";
---

<Base
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="How F1Visa.Net collects, uses, and protects your personal information. Operated by Web3 Freedom Club DAO LLC."
>
	<LegalPage
		eyebrow="Privacy Policy"
		title="Your privacy, on the record."
		lead="F1Visa.Net is a free informational website that provides immigration guidance content for F-1 visa holders and applicants. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect when you use f1visa.net, how we use it, and the choices you have over your data."
		updated="September 10, 2026"
	>
		<h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
		<p>
			F1Visa.Net ("F1Visa.Net," "we," "us," or "our") is a free
			informational website that provides immigration guidance content for
			F-1 visa holders and applicants: guides, checklists, community
			resources, and Ai-assisted guidance. The site is operated by{" "}
			<strong>Web3 Freedom Club DAO LLC</strong>, a Colorado limited
			liability company in the United States. This Privacy Policy applies
			to your use of f1visa.net and the services we provide through it.
		</p>
		<p>
			The Service is informational only. You do not need an account to use
			it, we do not process payments on this site, and we do not ask you
			for sensitive documents or identification. By using the Service, you
			agree to the practices described in this policy.
		</p>

		<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
		<p>
			We collect only the information you choose to give us and a small
			amount of automatic usage data. We do not collect payment
			information, government-issued identification, or biometric data.
		</p>

		<h3>2.1 Information You Provide Directly</h3>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Contact inquiries:</strong> when you use the contact
				form, we receive your name, email address, university (optional),
				and the content of your message.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Waitlist signups:</strong> if you join the waitlist, we
				receive the email address (and any other details) you enter.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Community participation:</strong> if you create a profile
				on our separate community forum at community.f1visa.net, that
				platform collects the profile information and posts you
				contribute under its own terms and privacy practices.
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			We do not require an account to browse or use the educational content
			on this site, and we never collect payment card data.
		</p>

		<h3>2.2 Information Collected Automatically</h3>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Analytics:</strong> we use{" "}
				<strong>Matomo</strong>, a privacy-respecting, self-hosted web
				analytics tool, to understand aggregate visitor traffic. Matomo
				records pages visited, referral sources, device and browser
				information, approximate location derived from IP address, and
				similar basic usage signals.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Log and security data:</strong> our hosting provider
				(Cloudflare) generates server logs that may include IP addresses,
				request timestamps, and user-agent strings for security and
				reliability purposes.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Preferences:</strong> your browser may store a small
				preference for light or dark theme so the same choice is
				remembered on your next visit.
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
		<p>We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>To respond to you:</strong> answer contact inquiries and
				send waitlist updates when you ask for them.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>To improve the Service:</strong> understand aggregate
				traffic patterns, see which guides are useful, and improve our
				content and Ai-assisted guidance.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>To ensure safety and security:</strong> detect and
				respond to abuse, fraud, and security incidents.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>To comply with law:</strong> satisfy legal obligations and
				resolve disputes.
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			We do not use your information for advertising, and we do not build
			behavioral profiles of visitors.
		</p>

		<h2>4. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
		<p>
			We use Matomo for basic analytics. Matomo sets a small analytics
			cookie to recognize returning visitors so its reports can
			distinguish new visits from repeat visits and to respect do-not-track
			preferences. We do not use advertising cookies, tracking pixels, or
			social media trackers, and we do not share visitor data with
			advertising networks.
		</p>
		<p>
			You can opt out of Matomo analytics by enabling "Do Not Track" in
			your browser, by using a browser extension that blocks analytics
			scripts, or by contacting us to opt out. If you opt out, we may still
			retain limited server log data used for security, as described
			above.
		</p>

		<h2>5. How We Share Your Information</h2>
		<p>
			We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We do not
			share it for third-party advertising. We share information only with
			service providers that help us operate the Service, or as required
			by law:
		</p>
		<table>
			<thead>
				<tr>
					<th>Service Provider</th>
					<th>What They Process</th>
					<th>Why</th>
				</tr>
			</thead>
			<tbody>
				<tr>
					<td><strong>Cloudflare</strong></td>
					<td>Request logs, IP addresses, serving infrastructure</td>
					<td>Hosting, CDN delivery, DDoS protection, reliability</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td><strong>Matomo (self-hosted)</strong></td>
					<td>Aggregated usage events for this site</td>
					<td>Privacy-respecting web analytics</td>
				</tr>
			</tbody>
		</table>
		<p>
			We may also disclose information (a) to comply with a court order,
			subpoena, or other legal process; (b) to enforce our Terms of
			Service; (c) to protect the rights, property, or safety of
			F1Visa.Net, our visitors, or the public; or (d) in connection with a
			merger, acquisition, reorganization, or transfer of our assets.
		</p>

		<h2>6. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Contact inquiries and waitlist signups:</strong> retained
				for as long as needed to respond and serve you, then deleted.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Analytics data:</strong> retained in aggregated form for
				the period configured in Matomo, then automatically deleted.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Server logs:</strong> retained on a rolling basis for
				security and reliability purposes.
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			You may request deletion of your personal information at any time.
			Unless we are required by law to keep it, we will delete or anonymize
			it. Email{" "}
			<a href="mailto:support@f1visa.net">support@f1visa.net</a> to make a
			request (see Section 7 for your full rights).
		</p>

		<h2>7. Your Rights and Choices</h2>

		<h3>7.1 Access, Correction, and Deletion</h3>
		<p>
			You may request a copy of the personal information we hold about you,
			ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it at any time. To exercise
			any of these rights, email{" "}
			<a href="mailto:support@f1visa.net">support@f1visa.net</a> with the
			subject "Privacy Request." We will verify your identity before acting
			on your request and will respond within the timeframe required by
			applicable law.
		</p>

		<h3>7.2 California and Colorado Residents</h3>
		<p>
			If you are a California resident, the California Consumer Privacy Act
			(CCPA) and the California Privacy Rights Act (CPRA) provide rights to
			know, delete, and correct personal information, subject to certain
			limitations. If you are a Colorado resident, the Colorado Privacy Act
			provides similar rights. We do not sell or share personal information
			for cross-context behavioral advertising, and we do not profile
			visitors, so no opt-out of those practices is needed today.
		</p>

		<h3>7.3 EEA, UK, and Other Regions</h3>
		<p>
			If you are located in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom,
			or another region with comparable privacy law, you may have the right
			to access, rectify, erase, restrict, and port your personal
			information, and to withdraw consent at any time. We process personal
			information on the basis of your consent, our legitimate interests in
			operating the Service, and compliance with legal obligations. To
			exercise these rights, contact us using the details in Section 12.
		</p>

		<h2>8. International Data Transfers</h2>
		<p>
			F1Visa.Net is operated in the United States, and the Service uses
			Cloudflare's global edge network. If you access the Service from
			outside the United States, your information may be processed and
			stored in the United States and other countries where our service
			providers operate. By using the Service, you understand that your
			information may be transferred to and processed in the United
			States.
		</p>

		<h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
		<p>
			The Service is intended for individuals who are at least 18 years
			old, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from
			children under the age of 16. If you believe a child has provided us
			with personal information, please contact us and we will delete
			it.
		</p>

		<h2>10. Data Security</h2>
		<p>
			We take reasonable and appropriate technical and organizational
			measures to protect the information we hold, including encryption in
			transit (TLS), access controls, and regular security hardening. No
			method of transmission or storage is 100 percent secure, and we
			cannot guarantee absolute security.
		</p>

		<h2>11. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
		<p>
			We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we make
			material changes, we will post the updated policy on this page and
			update the "Last updated" date. Your continued use of the Service
			after changes become effective constitutes acceptance of the revised
			policy.
		</p>

		<h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
		<p>
			If you have questions, concerns, or complaints about this Privacy
			Policy or our privacy practices, or if you wish to exercise your
			rights, please contact us:
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Company:</strong> Web3 Freedom Club DAO LLC
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Email:</strong>{" "}
				<a href="mailto:support@f1visa.net">support@f1visa.net</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://f1visa.net">f1visa.net</a>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			If we are unable to resolve your concern, you may have the right to
			file a complaint with the data protection authority or state attorney
			general in your jurisdiction.
		</p>
	</LegalPage>
</Base>
